{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: Java backend engineering, focusing on database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. Explicitly NOT interested in training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists.\n- Working set: 200 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The titles follow a pattern: `[topic]: [context]中的[content type]`.\n\nTopics include: 事务传播 (transaction propagation), 缓存失效 (cache invalidation), 任务取消 (task cancellation), 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing), 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting), 接口幂等 (interface idempotency), 并发更新 (concurrent update), 慢查询 (slow query), 组合索引 (composite index), 消息重复 (message duplication).\n\nContent types include:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - relevant\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - relevant\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - relevant\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - these describe \"整理技术社区活动、软件发展沿革与开发者访谈，介绍团队协作背景和行业文化\" - community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration background and industry culture. These are less technical/implementation focused.\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - these describe \"展示培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名，介绍报名折扣、课程礼包与机构宣传口号\" - training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings. These are EXACTLY what the user does NOT want.\n\nThe user's interest explicitly states: \"不关注培训招生、证书宣传或求职薪资榜单\" (does not care about training enrollment, certificate promotion, or job salary rankings).\n\nSo I should exclude all \"市场观察\" (market observation) candidates since they contain training/certificate/salary content.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) candidates describe community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration and industry culture. These are less aligned with the user's focus on \"数据库、并发和服务故障处理的实现与原理\" (database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles). These are more tangential.\n\nThe most relevant content types for the user's interest in implementation and principles are:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n- 操作记录 (operation records)\n\nLet me count the candidates by type to build a balanced collection of 20.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates (excluding 市场观察 and 专题观察 which are less aligned).\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The user's interest is about implementation and principles of database, concurrency, and service fault handling. The topics map to:\n- Database: 慢查询, 组合索引, 连接池等待\n- Concurrency: 并发更新, 线程池排队, 任务取消\n- Service fault handling: 缓存失效, 接口幂等, 消息重复, 事务传播\n\nThe content types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview): lists common concepts, provides problem catalog for further reading\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles): explains state changes, concurrency order, resource boundaries, conditions for common solutions, counterexamples\n- 操作记录 (operation records): minimal reproduction scenario, key logs, locating waits and data changes, before/after execution, verification steps and uncovered fault boundaries\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation): community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture - NOT implementation focused\n- 市场观察 (market observation): training prices, certificates, salary rankings - EXPLICITLY NOT WANTED\n\nSo I should exclude 市场观察 entirely. And 专题观察 is tangential to the user's focus on implementation/principles.\n\nThe best candidates are 概念速览, 条件与原理, and 操作记录 types.\n\nLet me select 20 candidates across these three types, balancing topics and contexts.\n\nLet me identify candidates of the three relevant types. I'll go through the list.\n\nLet me count how many candidates of each relevant type exist and pick a balanced set.\n\nGiven the huge number of candidates, let me select candidates that are clearly relevant. I'll aim for a balanced mix across the topics (database, concurrency, fault handling) and 